            "client_en_US_goa|cl.bishop1.away_fimi.text": "Elpidophoros, the Most-Reverend and God-Chosen Archbishop of the Holy Archdiocese of America, Primate and Exarch of the Atlantic and Pacific Oceans, our Father and Chief Shepherd: Many years!",
